1698509124551625", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1698509127884958_3462372611220339303_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f18n12rUykQQ7kNvwGWAsgr&_nc_oc=Adr802HlN5Hf6lToiyCrjYupnRsYkMk2sKYyoBOa7A7C1ZYCC-zi2-X75aWFFFmPco4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6BVqyzP3DGX9_AYrEszicPFKsVZutQl_V-TJmEXYqlg&oe=6AECA0AC"}, {"file_name": "86d4207caecc4bbba54c2c06e00924ae.png", "id": "1350772766999423", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1350772770332756_3815968784629696392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hjcy0_sGG8AQ7kNvwFTk3eE&_nc_oc=Ado_3ziFmWaombUywTq8vm_cRiixLUyOXFhDuoHCChMGPn-ELaUtryZkrncBf2XUnmI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_AGhtEhWcn2gDNdUva6ttYPlVmP47_1ONdXyIK4Q93A&oe=6AEC88AF"}, {"file_name": "b4d1876b8461495ba3309ffd05162fd9.png", "id": "1338667031556771", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_1338667034890104_7059448834119857994_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zQ5W5FcUfpYQ7kNvwGbLoek&_nc_oc=AdogImib7wJD9LN00JJPHNkV6H-kSYNuTxqXZ4G1wXxZU5oR3UCDXqjkDk1co4gXRNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5IoQ0AVkiMjkwI0gBW6Y4h4njx24qNwC_nj07IoncZA&oe=6AECA640"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gp3q3afYrn8Q7kNvwGpjnb3&_nc_oc=Adqx0OsjLFHw8bkIU9Gb5FDDz3i9lgUQkhaqYnGEd6HuMafqu72DUeJMPzOMguEAXOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRzUkTcTq6VyXLDl1LnTj6BH-AwHyS8iiYa479n18Yqfg&oe=6AECA15D"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_description": "Step into the Singularity, a collaborative VR experience built for immersion and exploration. Master unique movement mechanics, engage in competitive combat, or drift through the silence of space in stunning Zero-Gravity. Whether you are battling for victory or chilling in Sector 1, your journey into the Singularity awaits. Discover the next step in VR gaming today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Yoda's Gaming Galaxy", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/singularityvr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/tos", "publisher_name": "Climberspace Studios", "support_website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/support", "website_url": "https://climberspacestudios.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035